# Rec #95 was originally MINTED 2026-06-23 as @cascade-as-loss-lens-
# substrate-decl (Mara canonical `ce4874b`; `docs/specs/recognitions/
# recognition-95-cascade-as-loss-lens-substrate-decl.md`). Alex
